          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo, kutoka mto Eufrate hadi mpakani mwa Misri, Mwenyezi-Mungu ataipura nafaka yake, nanyi Waisraeli mtakusanywa mmojammoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo, tarumbeta kubwa itapigwa na watu wote wa Israeli waliopotea nchini Ashuru au waliotawanywa nchini Misri watarudi na kumwabudu Mwenyezi-Mungu juu ya mlima mtakatifu huko Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
